Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The experiments we've run so far
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,prove that the D-Mails are being sent to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't change the outcome of my match with Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem with you, not with the D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There are problems with the system,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,including the issue with Lukako,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we work on it, we can turn it into a real time machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You were listening to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris just brought your order!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want any maple syrup or milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can have my everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret Move: Stir While Gazing Into Their Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm so jealous I could explode, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma, what do you mean by a time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can seduce me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,into giving up classified information?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ask Kyouma then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru-nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Daru would betray me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We built a machine that sends texts to the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and by "we," I mean mostly me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was entirely too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Messages to the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:18.98,op trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
