Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stupid Daru...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}spreading our secrets to outsiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you take it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was crying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You were clearly crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are still red.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's in my eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, an old soap opera?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm not crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cristin—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!{muttered} Don't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an important ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you want to talk, I'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as planned, she fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can use her for all the grunt work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you heading to Kyouma's?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he wanted me to bring lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen the time machine, Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this big sparky thing, and it's kind of scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a time machine out of the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii doesn't really want him doing that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like Okarin is leaving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin our Round—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin! Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii says she isn't cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super-realistic portrayal of a school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment, and she doesn't have to put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's yours, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait. I said we're having a Round Table!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted me to bring lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it isn't anything important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that after you hear the discussion topic...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Physical time travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, is there still barley tea in the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization has initiated an operation to tear apart the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma's words, my words,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,fail to reach them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you ignoring my awesome topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send messages to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send 36 bytes plus some extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Three messages, each with six characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to experiment, why not be the guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's if you don't mind ending up as a gel-Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gel-Okarin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's experiments demonstrate the difficulties
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,inherent to physical time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even using the LHC, the largest particle accelerator in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,they've had no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly do it with this equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do the messages get to the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's trying to use the lifter-black hole combination
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to achieve time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The PhoneWave probably works on the same principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But the microwave doesn't have anything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,to function as a lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're limited in the times we can send D-Mail too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently, we can't be sure that this machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,really sends messages to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we should deal with more relevant issues first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,99.9% of science is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call yourself a scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is hopeless. Better do something quick.{TL: "this guy is hopeless, i have to do something soon."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on topic already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuing on to the reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,how's the translation of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's server documents going, Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say, @channeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you sure know your memes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue your investigations...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,@channeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's up next. How's the hacking coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I analyze the mysterious program
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,on the other server, there'll probably be no change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the IBN 5100 analysis going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be great if I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't started the analysis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,did I, by any chance, fail to find the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I choose to believe what you say, you found the IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried it back here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the only one with any memory of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Mails probably changed the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Changed the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've only sent minor stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the butterfly effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending one message into the past
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,causes the worldline to split,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,from a world where we didn't buy a LOTO SIX ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to one where we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little, this changes what was meant to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One change causes another,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and they pile on top of one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the long-recognized risks of altering the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where is the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask this instead:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, when I asked my dad, he said it used to be here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an IBN 5100 at Yanabayashi Shrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows when it was taken or by whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's strange to donate a PC to a shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the list of ten questions I wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask the maids at the next event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"If you could go back and redo one thing from your past, what would it be?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do, Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris... doesn't look back on her past! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the task of the cat-eared maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,who brings everyone happiness, to forge ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your family give it to Yanabayashi Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're right. My daddy did have a lot of old PCs.{*/a/ says this line is wrong, apparently.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,is this related to the time machine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A metal Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want a metal Upa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to stand there staring at it? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you buy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a limited-edition that sold out before I could buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As you might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"This encounter was the choice of Steins Gate!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use it for stuff like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why are you two following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've stayed back at the lab with the assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I heard you were going to Faris's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go and play too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Faris tell me to come to her house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kirari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,FB said it was there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, you mentioned the IBN 5100...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know either?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka's so pretty and stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd make a great cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, you know Shining Finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought her to the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After Moeka sent her D-Mail,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she disappeared from everyone's memory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then, after Luka sent his D-Mail,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they knew her again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Little by little, the world changes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}each time a D-Mail is sent to the past then?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems it's on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The mistress will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Butler cafés aren't my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A real butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone looks like ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures he'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's Faris wearing her normal clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I must question your true identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...Faris, nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to explain, then I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's family owns all the land around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Akiba is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Akiba now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Faris's real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Akiha Rumiho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's real name is Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sad attempt to escape reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Faris was the one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,who asked to bring the culture of moe to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And she works as an angel at MayQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,to further spread the culture of moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And my eyes are also splendid for recognizing her before anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but... keep it a secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to treat me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with Faris-love, just like you always have!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will! Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, nyan-nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No nyan-nyans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what about the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, I have a simple request...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to arrange a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want you to let me use the D-Mail, just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! The D-Mail is absolutely off-limits to outsiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why not make Faris a lab mem too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending more messages to the past would be—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent the LOTO SIX number back to try and make money,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you won't send one for Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I stop now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}there's no guarantee that the IBN 5100 will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this is any indication...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But as Mayuri said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:17:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to become a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now Lab Mem 007, Akiha Ru—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you want to send it back ten years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As leader of the lab, it's my job to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No. A maiden's private life is off-limits to guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's wrong to look at someone's emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree! Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then put your hand on the send button and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up on me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't she know she's my assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin Kyouma. Don't just hang up on me without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin? Oh, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a prank call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you saw my number on the display.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, those first words
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,were creepy enough to make me hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you are terrified of the mighty Hououin Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up on me! She hung up on me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, aren't you ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, cold-blooded pervert girl genius...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the Zomb—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name is Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be eternally grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'd set the PhoneWave (name subject to change)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to the values I proferred in my earlier message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have just said that from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, that isn't what "proffer" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:20:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop calling it the PhoneWave (name subject to change) already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Celeb Sev!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be polite, and you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they not like each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.24,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\frz342.44\blur0.75\pos(784.5,223.5)}Will you send?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The electricity's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Send it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Daddy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you talking to Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's dad has this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of refined air about him, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! You can tell he's Faris's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about an IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that name in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I parted with mine a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you give it to Yanabayashi Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before Faris sent her D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard that the IBN 5100 disappeared after it had been given to Yanabayashi Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But now, the shrine never got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Each time we send a message, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something may be changing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}even without me being aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's possible that we've already done something that can't be undone.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.07,0:22:30.12,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,1500)}kisei sareta shikai mujihi naru
