Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin! Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is going to Nakano to buy a {\i1}Lovely Sword{\i0} comic.{Ai-Sword}
