Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kouga Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakano's far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish there was a Toranoana comic shop here.
